\[\left(\frac{1}{2}\left(a+\frac{a^2c}{a^2+b^2}\right),\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{a^2-ac}{b}+\frac{abc}{a^2+b^2}\right)\right)=\left(\frac{a^3+a^2c+ab^2}{2(a^2+b^2)},\frac{a^4+a^2b^2-a^3c}{2b(a^2+b^2)}\right).\]
The slope of  $PF$  is
