As in the above solutions, if  $4 \nmid \ell-r$ , then after  $4\ell r$  seconds the car is back to its initial state, so the task is not always possible.

Now suppose  $4 \mid \ell - r$ . Since there are  $\ell$  left turns and  $r$  right turns, after  $\ell r$  seconds the car is in the same direction. We claim that after  $\ell r$  seconds, the car is in the same direction, but one unit ahead; this is sufficient.

