We want to show a contradiction if we assume otherwise. Our condition is equivalent to
\begin{align*}
&5^q \equiv -5^p \implies 5^{q-1} \equiv -1 \implies 5^{2(q-1)} \equiv 1 \quad \pmod{p} 
