&\operatorname{ord}_q5 \mid \gcd(2(p-1),q-1) \quad \pmod q 
\end{align*}

Note  $\operatorname{ord}_p5$  must divide  $2(q-1)$  but not  $q-1$ , and symmetrically for  $\operatorname{ord}_q5$ , so  $v_2$  tells us
