\end{vmatrix}
)=i(x-y)(y-z)(z-x)/4xyz $$   $B=\overline{w,y}\cap \overline{x, py}=\frac{xpw+xpy-wx-wpy}{xp-w}$  $C=\overline{w, z}\cap \overline{x, pz}=\frac{pxw+pxz-wx-pzw}{xp-w}$  $Y=y+z-\frac{yz}{x}$ Thus the area of triangle  $\frac{YBC}{(i/4)}$  is  $$ |\begin{vmatrix}
y+z-yz/x & \frac{y+z-x}{yz} & 1 
\frac{xpw+xpy-wx-wpy}{xp-w} & -\frac{w+y-x-yp}{y(xp-w)} & 1 
\frac{pxw+pxz-wx-pzw}{xp-w} & -\frac{w+z-x-zp}{z(xp-w)} & 1 
\end{vmatrix}| $$  Which is  $$ \frac{\begin{vmatrix}
y+z-yz/x & \frac{y+z-x}{yz} & 1 
-(xpyw+xpy^2-wxy-wpy^2) & w+y-x-yp & w-xp 
wpz^2+wxz-xpz^2-xpzw& w+z-x-zp & w-xp 
\end{vmatrix}}{(xp-w)^2} $$  which is   $$ \frac{\begin{vmatrix}
