(z-y)(wpz+wpy+wx-xpy-xpz-xpw) & (z-y)(1-p) & 0 
wpz^2+wxz-xpz^2-xpzw& w+z-x-zp & w-xp 
\end{vmatrix}}{(xp-w)^2} $$  which is   $$ \frac{(z-y)\begin{vmatrix}
y+z-yz/x & \frac{y+z-x}{yz} & 1 
wpz+wpy+wx-xpy-xpz-xpw & (1-p) & 0 
-wpyz+xpyz& w-x & w-xp 
\end{vmatrix}}{(xp-w)^2} $$  which is   $$ \frac{(z-y)\begin{vmatrix}
y+z-yz/x+yp+zp-xp & \frac{y+z-x}{yz} & 1 
wpz+wpy+wx-xpy-xpz-xpw+yzp-yzp^2 & (1-p) & 0 
