<details><summary>Haha complex bash goes brrrr</summary>Let  $(ABC) \ \text{be the unit circle}$ . $\text{Circumcenter} \equiv O = 0$  $\overline a = \frac 1a, \quad \overline b = \frac 1b, \quad \overline c = \frac 1c$  $k = \frac{p + b}{2}$  and  $l = \frac{q + c}{2}$ Using the complex chord result we have  $p = a + c - ac\overline p$  and  $q = a + b - ab\overline q$  $k - l = \frac{p+b - q-c}{2}$ Since  $PQXY$  is cyclic we have  $$ \frac{a-b}{p-q} \cdot \frac{a-c}{k-l} \in \mathbb R $$    $$ \implies \frac{a-b}{p-q} \cdot \frac{a-c}{p+b-q-c} \in \mathbb R $$    $$ \implies \frac{a-b}{p-q} \cdot \frac{a-c}{p+b-q-c} = \frac{\frac{b-a}{ab}}{\overline p - \overline q} \cdot \frac{\frac{c-a}{ac}}{\overline p - \overline q + \frac 1b - \frac 1c} $$    $$ \implies \frac{a^2 bc}{(p-q)(p-q + b - c)} = \frac{1}{(\overline p - \overline q)(\overline p - \overline q + \frac 1b - \frac 1c)} $$    $$ \implies (p-q)(p-q + b - c) = a^2bc(\overline p - \overline q)(\overline p - \overline q + \frac 1b - \frac 1c) $$    $$ \implies (p-q)(p-q + b - c) = a(\overline{p}-\overline{q})(ac+b(ac\overline{p})-ab-c(ab\overline{q})) $$    $$ \implies (p-q)(p-q + b - c) = aq + cq - pq - acq \overline q - abp \overline p + ap + bp - pq $$    $$ \implies (p-q)(p-q + b - c) = aq+cq-pq-ac|q|^2-ab|p|^2+ap+bp-pq $$    $$ \implies aq+cq-pq-ac|q|^2-ab|p|^2+ap+bp-pq-bp+bq-p^2+pq+cp-cq+pq-q^2 = 0 $$    $$ \implies ab|q|^2+ac|p|^2-ac|q|^2-ab|p|^2 = 0 $$    $$ \implies b|q|^2+ c|p|^2 - c|q|^2 - b|p|^2 = 0 $$    $$ \implies (c-b)(|p|^2 - |q|^2) = 0 $$    $$ \implies |p|^2 = |q|^2 \implies |p| = |q| \ \text{(since  $|x| > 0$ )} $$    $$ \implies |p-0| = |q-0| $$    $$ \implies OP = OQ $$</details></details>
